<div id="article_show_text">Many requests have arrived for the old stable builds of RawTherapee, therefore RT 2.4.1 for Windows (only 32-bit) and for Linux (32-bit and 64-bit) are <a href="/downloads">available again</a>.<br /><br />Important notes:<br /><ol><li>2.4.1 is a deprecated version, it is not supported anymore.</li><li>It was the last stable release before the opening of the source code. If you want to download a newer version, take a look at the <a href="/downloads">download center</a>. The nightly builds are usually stable enough to be used, but not considered as final releases yet.</li><li>There was no Macintosh version of the 2.4 branch. If you use mac, try a nightly build from the download center.</li></ol></div>

